@startuml
title Dependências entre módulos

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "rheo-lbm\n<<composition root>>" as Root #E8EAF6
package "ui" as UI #F3E5F5
package "application" as Application #E3F2FD
package "renderer" as Renderer #E8F5E9
package "simulation" as Simulation #E8F5E9
package "assets" as Assets #FFF3E0
package "domain" as Domain #FFFDE7
package "graphics" as Graphics #ECEFF1
package "platform" as Platform #ECEFF1
package "events" as Events #FFFDE7

Root --> UI
Root --> Application
Root --> Renderer
Root --> Simulation
Root --> Assets
Root --> Graphics
Root --> Platform
Root --> Events

UI --> Application : estado / comandos
UI ..> Renderer : implementa IOverlayPass
UI --> Graphics
UI --> Platform

Application --> Domain
Application --> Assets : portas
Application --> Simulation : porta de sessão

Assets --> Domain
Simulation --> Domain
Simulation --> Graphics

Renderer --> Application : SceneState
Renderer --> Simulation : FluidRenderSnapshot
Renderer --> Graphics
Renderer --> Platform
Renderer --> Events

Graphics --> Domain
Graphics --> Platform
Platform --> Events

legend bottom
  |= Módulo |= Implementação concreta privada |
  | platform | GLFW |
  | graphics | Vulkan |
  | assets | GDAL e YAML |
  | ui | ImGui |
endlegend

@enduml
